ltk-census-history: license and disclaimer

THE DATA

This repository records facts about the files of League of Legends game client builds: their
paths, sizes, hashes and checksums, their formats, and the structure and values of their data,
written out as text. It holds none of the game's assets as shipped: no texture, model, animation,
sound or other game file.

To the extent possible under law, the contributors to this repository waive all copyright and
related or neighbouring rights they hold in its data and its text, and dedicate them to the public
domain. Anyone may copy, modify, distribute and use them, for any purpose, without asking
permission and without attribution.

This waiver covers only what the contributors could hold. It grants no right in Riot Games' own
work, which this repository describes and does not own.

QUOTED TEXT

Strings from the game's data, such as names, descriptions and lines, appear in the `.rito` files
as quoted values, exactly as the game stores them. They are quotations, kept to document the data
they belong to, as community references such as the League of Legends Wiki quote champion lines
and spell descriptions. They remain Riot Games' work: the waiver above does not cover them, and
quoting them here grants no right in them.

